<title>USA: Euromed names Roozekrans chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Euromed names Roozekrans chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>EuroMed Inc said Wednesday that its board has named N.T.P. Roozekrans as its new chief executive, chairman and president.</p>
<p>EuroMed said Roozekrans replaces Francois Hinnen, who resigned from the three positions.</p>
